Otherwise, we can just start lighting the outside.

4585
04:32:44,770 --> 04:32:45,950
It's not a big deal, either.

4586
04:32:59,790 --> 04:33:01,350
Listen, you hear that?

4587
04:33:03,610 --> 04:33:04,750
Yeah, me neither.

4588
04:33:05,190 --> 04:33:06,130
There's no mobs.

4589
04:33:06,650 --> 04:33:07,270
Wonderful.

4590
04:33:08,630 --> 04:33:10,150
At least in the immediate area.

4591
04:33:20,810 --> 04:33:23,090
I mean, we don't have to make it all about lighting these tunnels.

4592
04:33:23,250 --> 04:33:25,050
We can also grab, like, supplies on the way, you know?

4593
04:33:25,130 --> 04:33:26,290
It'll be a combi mission.

4594
04:33:27,350 --> 04:33:28,370
Combo mission, I guess.

4595
04:33:32,310 --> 04:33:33,250
Is this too dark?

4596
04:33:33,770 --> 04:33:34,390
Not sure.

4597
04:33:34,590 --> 04:33:37,210
If in doubt, maybe I just put a torch anyway.

4598
04:33:43,090 --> 04:33:44,550
Where was that spider I heard, though?

4599
04:33:47,630 --> 04:33:49,070
Oh, here we go, enemies.

4600
04:33:53,710 --> 04:33:54,370
Holy shit.

4601
04:34:00,290 --> 04:34:00,650
Nice.

4602
04:34:01,630 --> 04:34:03,010
No, I don't need that, actually.

4603
04:34:03,170 --> 04:34:04,430
Yeah, the rest can...

4604
04:34:10,140 --> 04:34:11,800
We go towards the sounds.

4605
04:34:14,040 --> 04:34:22,860
Little by little, we're gonna weed out every single place where these miscreants can appear.

4606
04:34:28,160 --> 04:34:29,840
Let me just grab that real fast.

4607
04:34:32,810 --> 04:34:34,810
Where I need it for the ultimate rail network.

4608
04:34:37,290 --> 04:34:38,470
It sounds like he's here.

4609
04:34:39,670 --> 04:34:41,030
If I were to bet my money.

4610
04:34:45,230 --> 04:34:45,970
Wait, what?

4611
04:34:46,310 --> 04:34:46,610
Right here?

4612
04:34:48,130 --> 04:34:48,830
Ah, you know what?

4613
04:34:48,830 --> 04:34:50,610
He's probably below or above me or something.

4614
04:34:54,110 --> 04:34:54,550
Damn.

4615
04:34:56,330 --> 04:35:00,130
Let's just keep exploring and maybe we'll naturally get to where that skeleton is.

4616
04:35:19,210 --> 04:35:20,350
Ooh, there's more.

4617
04:35:20,470 --> 04:35:21,550
Okay, there's more upstairs.

4618
04:35:23,090 --> 04:35:23,870
I see.

4619
04:35:27,250 --> 04:35:29,810
Man, these tunnels are sprawling.

4620
04:35:30,170 --> 04:35:31,130
Ooh, nice!

4621
04:35:31,270 --> 04:35:31,710
Nametag!

4622
04:35:31,950 --> 04:35:32,770
Fuck yeah!

4623
04:35:33,550 --> 04:35:34,790
I need that bad.

4624
04:35:36,110 --> 04:35:37,990
Got some coals as well, and gold.

4625
04:35:41,890 --> 04:35:43,350
Yeah, let's say mining.

4626
04:35:43,550 --> 04:35:44,050
Put that in there.

4627
04:35:45,270 --> 04:35:47,650
Let me try and be super organized here.

4628
04:35:52,200 --> 04:35:57,300
Did I bring my... Oh my god, I didn't bring my box, my shulker boxes.

4629
04:35:59,580 --> 04:36:00,020
Fuck.

4630
04:36:01,940 --> 04:36:02,540
It's fine.

4631
04:36:13,260 --> 04:36:14,240
Is this too dark?

4632
04:36:14,340 --> 04:36:15,280
I feel like it's a little dark.

4633
04:36:20,850 --> 04:36:27,790
Also, the problem right now is also I don't know where I am compared to my Orphan Crusher.

4634
04:36:29,570 --> 04:36:33,790
Like, am I straight below it or am I too far east or west or something?

4635
04:36:33,930 --> 04:36:34,330
I don't know.

4636
04:36:35,330 --> 04:36:41,130
At some point, I may have to just dig straight up, you know, and get a feeling for that.

4637
04:36:42,130 --> 04:36:46,730
Because I don't want to start doing this stuff too far away either, right?

4638
04:36:48,370 --> 04:36:49,170
Golden apple.

4639
04:36:51,670 --> 04:36:52,470
No, I don't want that.

4640
04:36:52,550 --> 04:36:53,470
I do want torches, though.

4641
04:36:54,010 --> 04:36:54,770
That makes me happy.

4642
04:36:56,390 --> 04:36:57,190
Same as that.

4643
04:36:57,330 --> 04:36:57,750
And these.

4644
04:36:59,730 --> 04:37:00,130
Nice.

4645
04:37:04,630 --> 04:37:06,170
Ah, this is so cozy, isn't it?

4646
04:37:08,970 --> 04:37:10,350
I yearn for the mines.

4647
04:37:14,310 --> 04:37:15,350
I love saying that.

4648
04:37:22,390 --> 04:37:23,610
Look at all this coal.

4649
04:37:24,350 --> 04:37:25,730
This is the real jackpot.

4650
04:37:37,350 --> 04:37:43,150
And the good part about this is that there's nothing that has mending on it that is soaking up all this delicious experience.

4651
04:37:43,850 --> 04:37:44,590
It's me.

4652
04:37:45,510 --> 04:37:46,370
I get it.

4653
04:37:51,340 --> 04:37:52,260
Light that up.

4654
04:37:52,520 --> 04:37:54,720
So we know there's a spot above us as well.

4655
04:37:56,140 --> 04:37:57,260
Let's try and find that.

4656
04:38:00,880 --> 04:38:03,040
So we heard enemies over here somewhere.

4657
04:38:05,380 --> 04:38:06,080
What was that?

4658
04:38:06,600 --> 04:38:07,500
Oh yeah, okay.

4659
04:38:09,780 --> 04:38:10,960
This has to be it, right?

4660
04:38:11,160 --> 04:38:11,340
No?

4661
04:38:18,210 --> 04:38:20,110
I want to spot where I could go up.

4662
04:38:22,950 --> 04:38:24,070
Down here, perhaps.

4663
04:38:31,610 --> 04:38:32,930
Here we go, here we go.

4664
04:38:34,470 --> 04:38:35,850
Let's do this in a smart way.

4665
04:38:37,650 --> 04:38:38,430
Oh, nice!

4666
04:38:41,960 --> 04:38:47,240
I'm not gonna put this on unstable ground in case it breaks at some point.

4667
04:38:48,560 --> 04:38:49,740
Pretty smart, huh?

4668
04:38:50,360 --> 04:38:52,820
Forward thinking is what we do here.

4669
04:38:54,460 --> 04:38:55,680
You never know what could happen.

4670
04:38:55,820 --> 04:38:59,560
Maybe an enderman comes by and causes a cave-in like we saw just before.

4671
04:39:00,480 --> 04:39:01,860
It can happen, people.

4672
04:39:03,660 --> 04:39:05,340
You better be prepared for anything.

4673
04:39:11,120 --> 04:39:11,680
Then again.

4674
04:39:13,520 --> 04:39:17,560
They should not spawn... Oh wait, actually, Endermen spawn anywhere, right?

4675
04:39:18,220 --> 04:39:18,980
Doesn't even matter.

4676
04:39:20,000 --> 04:39:21,380
What kind of light you have.

4677
04:39:21,560 --> 04:39:22,920
They just go for it.

4678
04:39:24,340 --> 04:39:25,820
Wait, is this where I want it to go up?

4679
04:39:28,800 --> 04:39:29,640
I guess it is.

4680
04:39:29,760 --> 04:39:30,340
It is now.

4681
04:39:35,280 --> 04:39:36,960
Ah, but then I don't have...

4682
04:39:40,990 --> 04:39:42,370
Let's do something like this instead.

4683
04:39:43,010 --> 04:39:43,570
Yeah, I like that.

4684
04:39:48,190 --> 04:39:48,950
There we go.

4685
04:39:58,590 --> 04:40:02,050
This is actually way more work than I thought it would be.

4686
04:40:02,870 --> 04:40:03,310
Damn.

4687
04:40:07,090 --> 04:40:07,890
I gotta sneeze!

4688
04:40:15,030 --> 04:40:16,310
Okay, nice.

4689
04:40:26,990 --> 04:40:28,090
I hear a villager?

4690
04:40:30,470 --> 04:40:32,850
Wait, how close am I to the village right now?

4691
04:40:34,370 --> 04:40:35,250
The hell?

4692
04:40:37,870 --> 04:40:39,570
Where is this coming from?

4693
04:40:45,510 --> 04:40:46,490
Kind of want to go there.

4694
04:40:47,970 --> 04:40:48,830
He's this way.

4695
04:40:55,350 --> 04:40:55,950
Up here?

4696
04:41:03,130 --> 04:41:04,830
Oh nice, found some coal as well.

4697
04:41:13,540 --> 04:41:15,860
Okay, so I'm not hearing the villager anymore.

4698
04:41:17,320 --> 04:41:18,960
Which means I probably passed him.

4699
04:41:19,120 --> 04:41:20,580
So let's go back and dig up.

4700
04:41:23,200 --> 04:41:23,800
Light it.

4701
04:41:27,240 --> 04:41:28,180
Yeah, it's right here.

4702
04:41:29,480 --> 04:41:30,680
Let's try going straight up.

4703
04:41:31,900 --> 04:41:33,060
See if we can still hear him.

4704
04:41:47,210 --> 04:41:48,270
I can't hear him anymore.

4705
04:41:52,970 --> 04:41:53,910
Okay, I can hear him now.

4706
04:41:54,070 --> 04:41:54,650
What the hell?

4707
04:42:03,470 --> 04:42:04,450
Sounds like it's this way.

4708
04:42:04,970 --> 04:42:05,670
No, no, I was over here.

4709
04:42:05,850 --> 04:42:06,010
What?

4710
04:42:06,170 --> 04:42:07,150
Okay, I don't know.

4711
04:42:10,010 --> 04:42:10,850
Oh, he's closer?

4712
04:42:15,700 --> 04:42:16,800
Maybe?

4713
04:42:44,420 --> 04:42:45,400
No way.

4714
04:42:48,440 --> 04:42:49,280
Name tag!

4715
04:42:50,240 --> 04:42:50,820
Huge!

4716
04:42:56,380 --> 04:42:57,520
You're right here!

4717
04:43:02,360 --> 04:43:03,680
This is like a mystery!

4718
04:43:06,340 --> 04:43:07,720
Hold on, I'll be back for you.

4719
04:43:08,140 --> 04:43:09,020
Give me a moment.

4720
04:43:13,200 --> 04:43:14,040
Wait, what is this?

4721
04:43:14,240 --> 04:43:14,820
Activator rail?

4722
04:43:18,000 --> 04:43:18,980
Sure, put them in there.

4723
04:43:28,300 --> 04:43:31,960
Well, good thing I found these mines as well, because these are not lit.

4724
04:43:36,450 --> 04:43:38,530
Okay, so he is down over there.

4725
04:43:40,530 --> 04:43:42,210
Let me light this tunnel first.

4726
04:43:45,490 --> 04:43:46,090
Okay.

4727
04:43:52,010 --> 04:43:52,850
Right here.

4728
04:43:58,190 --> 04:43:59,470
My god!

4729
04:44:04,320 --> 04:44:05,440
What was your name?

4730
04:44:08,400 --> 04:44:09,480
Mindy or something?

4731
04:44:09,720 --> 04:44:10,620
I forgot your name.

4732
04:44:11,580 --> 04:44:13,200
How did you get down here?

4733
04:44:14,620 --> 04:44:16,300
Are you... Wait, there's water.

4734
04:44:16,520 --> 04:44:20,680
Did you somehow... You went exploring, didn't you?

4735
04:44:21,800 --> 04:44:22,800
I see.

4736
04:44:27,360 --> 04:44:29,060
Well, well, well.

4737
04:44:33,190 --> 04:44:35,970
You better give me a discount if I rescue you, you hear me?

4738
04:44:36,550 --> 04:44:36,910
Yeah.

4739
04:44:37,790 --> 04:44:38,190
Yeah.

4740
04:44:40,310 --> 04:44:42,550
How did you get yourself into this predicament?

4741
04:44:43,630 --> 04:44:44,770
That's what I want to know.

4742
04:44:52,690 --> 04:44:54,490
I'll leave you there for a bit, if you don't mind.

4743
04:44:56,810 --> 04:44:58,210
You've survived until now, right?

4744
04:44:58,230 --> 04:45:00,750
You'll probably survive a little bit longer as well.

4745
04:45:04,060 --> 04:45:05,120
Wait, I feel like I've been here.

4746
04:45:05,700 --> 04:45:07,640
That chest will not be that empty if not.

4747
04:45:09,920 --> 04:45:11,060
Yeah, see, I ducked this.

4748
04:45:18,810 --> 04:45:19,890
That's so weird.

4749
04:45:20,930 --> 04:45:22,290
So I've definitely been here.

4750
04:45:22,450 --> 04:45:23,190
There's lights.

4751
04:45:24,850 --> 04:45:25,370
What?

4752
04:45:25,650 --> 04:45:30,430
I don't understand how he could have... or she, I don't remember who it was.

4753
04:45:30,970 --> 04:45:31,950
Ended up down here!

4754
04:45:34,490 --> 04:45:37,470
That is a real noggin scratcher.

4755
04:45:41,230 --> 04:45:45,090
And yes, I'm starting to use that word now because I've been watching Rainbolt.

4756
04:45:52,070 --> 04:45:53,090
Just give me all of this, please.

4757
04:45:59,140 --> 04:46:03,300
Way too much of this crap here.

4758
04:46:03,540 --> 04:46:04,800
But I don't want to remove it.

4759
04:46:05,040 --> 04:46:05,380
I'm too lazy.

4760
04:46:08,100 --> 04:46:14,640
So obviously I'm not very systematic about my way of going through these tunnels here, but it is what it is.

4761
04:46:14,720 --> 04:46:18,220
I think if I were to try to be more systematic, I would just fuck up, you know?

4762
04:46:18,820 --> 04:46:21,000
At this point, I'm just gonna walk around.

4763
04:46:21,020 --> 04:46:23,200
If I see dark, I light it up.

4764
04:46:23,440 --> 04:46:24,460
It's as simple as that.

4765
04:46:25,420 --> 04:46:27,480
And if shit doesn't work down the line...

4766
04:46:27,820 --> 04:46:30,060
Well, back in the mines I go.

4767
04:46:33,480 --> 04:46:34,540
That's the strategy.

4768
04:46:40,560 --> 04:46:41,860
Let me light that as well.

4769
04:46:42,620 --> 04:46:43,840
Same as that one.

4770
04:46:44,620 --> 04:46:47,200
It's very cozy down here with all the lights now, I gotta say.

4771
04:46:47,360 --> 04:46:48,680
It almost feels like home, doesn't it?

4772
04:46:49,980 --> 04:46:53,080
Almost as if I was born in the mines.

4773
04:46:54,180 --> 04:46:55,880
You know, I belong in the mines.

4774
04:46:56,960 --> 04:46:59,340
Crazy things happen in the mines.

4775
04:47:00,120 --> 04:47:01,680
We light the mines.

4776
04:47:03,540 --> 04:47:05,500
Sometimes we also sight the mines.

4777
04:47:07,080 --> 04:47:08,320
Mine, do not the...

4778
04:47:08,540 --> 04:47:15,720
Mimes, but the mimes... How would you cite a mime if you make a quote?

4779
04:47:17,140 --> 04:47:18,440
How would you do that in a book?

4780
04:47:18,520 --> 04:47:20,200
Let's say you have the introduction, right?

4781
04:47:20,280 --> 04:47:23,660
And you have a little quip from a mime.

4782
04:47:23,780 --> 04:47:25,220
I don't know what the fuck I'm talking about.

4783
04:47:25,840 --> 04:47:27,740
Disregard the last 10 seconds.

4784
04:47:29,120 --> 04:47:30,960
Probably more like 50 seconds.

4785
04:47:32,540 --> 04:47:33,740
Put it right there.

4786
04:47:36,330 --> 04:47:39,970
Okay, this is... I'm putting way more torches than I need, but you know what?

4787
04:47:40,450 --> 04:47:42,150
Probably better to be safe than sorry, right?

4788
04:47:43,710 --> 04:47:49,990
Also, all of this is relying on me actually... or on this system working the way I think it does.

4789
04:47:51,190 --> 04:48:00,430
But I'm pretty sure... I mean, the sky experiment with it pretty much confirmed it in my book, but... Right?

4790
04:48:03,030 --> 04:48:03,550
Let's see.

4791
04:48:05,160 --> 04:48:06,400
Where the fuck was that villager?

4792
04:48:07,780 --> 04:48:09,160
I think I may have lost it.

4793
04:48:09,320 --> 04:48:09,800
But that's okay.

4794
04:48:10,300 --> 04:48:11,240
Not that I... You know what?

4795
04:48:11,700 --> 04:48:12,060
Fine.

4796
04:48:12,360 --> 04:48:13,080
I can stay there.

4797
04:48:13,320 --> 04:48:13,980
Don't really care.

4798
04:48:14,960 --> 04:48:15,720
It's all good.

4799
04:48:18,380 --> 04:48:20,580
Now I just gotta find... I can't find darkness.

4800
04:48:21,700 --> 04:48:22,880
It's too bright down here.

4801
04:48:24,340 --> 04:48:25,800
So I came from upstairs, right?

4802
04:48:25,940 --> 04:48:27,020
There must be a way back up.

4803
04:48:31,250 --> 04:48:33,430
What the... Eat the taters!

4804
04:48:43,430 --> 04:48:44,050
Here we go.

4805
04:48:45,650 --> 04:48:47,210
Oh wait, I was here just before, wasn't I?

4806
04:48:53,010 --> 04:48:54,230
Are you kidding me, man?

4807
04:48:59,200 --> 04:48:59,940
Who am I?

4808
04:49:00,440 --> 04:49:01,320
How do I get out?

4809
04:49:03,420 --> 04:49:05,160
Somehow I don't yearn for the mines right now.

4810
04:49:05,380 --> 04:49:07,500
I want to get out of the mines.

4811
04:49:08,700 --> 04:49:09,400
Oh, here we go.

4812
04:49:10,120 --> 04:49:11,800
This has to be... Oh, yeah, I see some darkness.

4813
04:49:12,980 --> 04:49:13,800
Can't have that.

4814
04:49:16,580 --> 04:49:16,940
Boom.

4815
04:49:24,060 --> 04:49:24,420
Damn.

4816
04:49:24,940 --> 04:49:25,440
Dead end.

4817
04:49:32,810 --> 04:49:33,850
Down here, maybe?

4818
04:49:34,170 --> 04:49:35,150
Nope, nope, nope.

4819
04:49:36,530 --> 04:49:37,090
Aha!

4820
04:49:39,250 --> 04:49:40,290
There we go.

4821
04:49:48,670 --> 04:49:49,910
This looks promising.

4822
04:49:59,750 --> 04:50:01,010
Oh, we got something up there.

4823
04:50:01,130 --> 04:50:02,510
Let me make a staircase to that.

4824
04:50:04,270 --> 04:50:04,950
Like that.

4825
04:50:08,510 --> 04:50:09,810
What do we got here?

4826
04:50:11,610 --> 04:50:12,050
Aha!

4827
04:50:14,130 --> 04:50:15,710
Bit of a common room, huh?

4828
04:50:19,890 --> 04:50:20,330
Enemies?

4829
04:50:20,610 --> 04:50:22,150
Ooh, this looks bad.

4830
04:50:25,170 --> 04:50:26,950
This does not look pleasant at all.

4831
04:50:27,070 --> 04:50:27,430
Uh-oh.

4832
04:50:31,460 --> 04:50:32,040
Good night.

4833
04:50:35,840 --> 04:50:40,060
Oh my god, look at all that cobweb down the... oh Jesus, it's like never ending.

4834
04:50:49,820 --> 04:50:52,880
As long as I have light here, this should not spawn, right?

4835
04:51:12,360 --> 04:51:13,160
Oh my god.

4836
04:51:13,400 --> 04:51:14,620
We are name-tagging!

4837
04:51:16,600 --> 04:51:17,000
Fantastic.

4838
04:51:17,580 --> 04:51:18,280
And more torches.

4839
04:51:18,380 --> 04:51:18,880
This is wonderful.

4840
04:51:19,220 --> 04:51:19,840
I'm getting fueled.

4841
04:51:23,920 --> 04:51:24,780
Put that in there.

4842
04:51:27,060 --> 04:51:28,880
Honestly, so far, this is a very good hole.

4843
04:51:30,280 --> 04:51:34,380
This has been very fruitful when it comes to coal and other things.

4844
04:51:39,170 --> 04:51:41,090
Okay, so there's a place up here.

4845
04:51:41,310 --> 04:51:42,110
Oh wait, that's this one.

4846
04:51:44,550 --> 04:51:45,630
Let's check this part out.

4847
04:51:50,410 --> 04:51:54,790
So the way I'm gonna get out of these mines, I'm just gonna dig straight up so I know where to come back down.

4848
04:52:00,760 --> 04:52:02,040
We can get rid of this stuff.

4849
04:52:03,340 --> 04:52:07,660
The brown mushrooms, I will keep them in grass.

4850
04:52:08,220 --> 04:52:11,160
Name tags is a drop, I would say.

4851
04:52:12,140 --> 04:52:14,140
It's not, but I'm gonna call it that now.

4852
04:52:14,940 --> 04:52:16,220
String, I don't really care about.

4853
04:52:16,540 --> 04:52:17,560
I have so much of it.

4854
04:52:18,800 --> 04:52:19,720
Same with wood.

4855
04:52:24,040 --> 04:52:25,180
The rest is nice.

4856
04:52:26,460 --> 04:52:26,960
Yep.

4857
04:52:39,470 --> 04:52:40,630
Hi, it's so nice.

4858
04:52:40,810 --> 04:52:41,810
Quiet down here right now.

4859
04:52:47,910 --> 04:52:48,430
Ooh.

4860
04:52:49,910 --> 04:52:50,910
Can't have that.

4861
04:52:58,530 --> 04:52:59,730
Light that up.

4862
04:53:01,530 --> 04:53:02,610
Honestly, even that one.

4863
04:53:02,870 --> 04:53:03,430
And this.

4864
04:53:04,810 --> 04:53:05,830
Better safe than sorry!

4865
04:53:16,570 --> 04:53:20,410
Kinda disappointed that I'm only level 12 after getting this much coal.

4866
04:53:21,850 --> 04:53:23,910
So coal really does not give a lot.

4867
04:53:43,410 --> 04:53:44,690
Taking that as well.

4868
04:53:45,630 --> 04:53:48,810
Oh man, I kind of hate that there's a whole mine system down here.

4869
04:53:48,950 --> 04:53:53,130
It makes everything so much more... well... annoying.

4870
04:53:53,410 --> 04:53:54,790
Oh my god, another nametag!

4871
04:53:55,230 --> 04:53:57,630
Dude, everyone is gonna have a name when we get back!

4872
04:53:59,850 --> 04:54:04,050
Nametag is... like, found easily down here.

4873
04:54:06,830 --> 04:54:07,610
So nice.

4874
04:54:15,560 --> 04:54:16,320
Oops.

4875
04:54:16,320 --> 04:54:17,300
Dead end?

4876
04:54:17,540 --> 04:54:17,820
Yeah.

4877
04:54:41,380 --> 04:54:43,240
Am I overdoing it with the coal?

4878
04:54:43,840 --> 04:54:48,140
Nah, you know, every time I say that, I always end up having the need for more coal.

4879
04:54:49,120 --> 04:54:52,640
There's never, ever, a reason to not mine coal.

4880
04:54:53,520 --> 04:54:55,760
Let that be heard across the continents.

4881
04:54:57,520 --> 04:54:59,500
Coal is always in demand.

4882
04:55:00,640 --> 04:55:02,100
And don't ever think it's not.

4883
04:55:03,860 --> 04:55:08,780
If I, myself, in the future, am thinking, you know what, I have too much coal.

4884
04:55:09,640 --> 04:55:10,360
You're wrong.

4885
04:55:11,080 --> 04:55:11,880
You don't.

4886
04:55:12,440 --> 04:55:13,280
You need more.

4887
04:55:14,620 --> 04:55:18,840
Because all that coal that you think you have too much of is going to end up being used at some point.

4888
04:55:20,740 --> 04:55:22,700
And then you'll regret not having more.

4889
04:55:25,500 --> 04:55:27,780
Let's just hope I remember these words to myself.

4890
04:55:28,760 --> 04:55:33,220
The next time... I'm not scared of that.

4891
04:55:34,500 --> 04:55:35,540
It's just a sound.

4892
04:55:35,800 --> 04:55:37,240
Why would I be scared of a sound?

4893
04:55:38,440 --> 04:55:39,260
Doesn't hurt me.

4894
04:55:44,790 --> 04:55:46,390
Okay, we got darkness down here.

4895
04:55:47,930 --> 04:55:49,910
That's the good thing about lighting places.

4896
04:55:50,390 --> 04:55:52,030
It's easy to tell where you haven't been.

4897
04:55:52,810 --> 04:55:53,730
Because they're dark.

4898
04:55:55,690 --> 04:55:57,870
Okay, we also got one there, so let's remember that.

4899
04:56:00,530 --> 04:56:03,350
And here I... Wait, where was this other place just now?

4900
04:56:04,850 --> 04:56:05,530
Was it here?

4901
04:56:05,770 --> 04:56:06,430
Yeah, it was.

4902
04:56:07,550 --> 04:56:08,670
Ooh, look at this.

4903
04:56:09,530 --> 04:56:10,070
Oh, okay.

4904
04:56:10,490 --> 04:56:10,810
Dead end.

4905
04:56:21,060 --> 04:56:21,460
Ah!

4906
04:56:22,080 --> 04:56:22,840
Is this where I came from?

4907
04:56:23,040 --> 04:56:23,920
I think it is.

4908
04:56:24,720 --> 04:56:26,200
This is still too dark down here.

4909
04:56:29,860 --> 04:56:31,700
Ooh, there's an upstairs here as well.

4910
04:56:44,670 --> 04:56:48,890
I can potentially use this for something later as well.

4911
04:56:49,130 --> 04:56:52,930
I'm not gonna... I kind of regret destroying all these in the beginning.

4912
04:56:53,790 --> 04:56:55,290
I didn't think about that.

4913
04:56:55,610 --> 04:56:57,730
Well, obviously, why would I?

4914
04:56:58,430 --> 04:57:03,030
But, you know, in hindsight, that would have been nice, not destroying those.

4915
04:57:04,430 --> 04:57:05,310
Okay, here we go.

4916
04:57:05,450 --> 04:57:05,810
Darkness.

4917
04:57:06,690 --> 04:57:07,810
My old friend.

4918
04:57:15,650 --> 04:57:16,710
What is this?

4919
04:57:19,830 --> 04:57:22,830
Ah, now we emerge in the cave proper.

4920
04:57:24,030 --> 04:57:27,290
And it looks like I've already been at work here with the lights.

4921
04:57:29,030 --> 04:57:30,030
Isn't that wonderful?

4922
04:57:35,190 --> 04:57:36,470
Okay, let's go in the cave.

4923
04:57:44,340 --> 04:57:45,720
Wait, which cave is this again?

4924
04:57:47,940 --> 04:57:50,260
Oh, it's the one I... Okay, I see, I see, I see.

4925
04:57:51,880 --> 04:57:53,160
We are simply back.

4926
04:57:56,080 --> 04:57:57,960
Am I going too crazy with the torches?

4927
04:57:58,140 --> 04:58:02,400
I feel like as time has gone on here, I'm placing way too many torches.

4928
04:58:05,720 --> 04:58:06,600
This was a dead end.

4929
04:58:09,200 --> 04:58:13,440
I'm pretty sure I didn't get everything here, but at some point you gotta call it quits, right?

4930
04:58:13,500 --> 04:58:14,040
What about up there?

4931
04:58:15,640 --> 04:58:17,620
It's like another level to it, to the whole thing.

4932
04:58:21,180 --> 04:58:22,180
Let's check that one out.

4933
04:58:24,120 --> 04:58:25,280
Yeah, a little bit of darkness.

4934
04:58:25,640 --> 04:58:26,480
Good thing I checked.

4935
04:58:31,740 --> 04:58:32,740
Same as here.

4936
04:58:33,600 --> 04:58:35,660
Oh yeah, we've got an area.

4937
04:58:38,900 --> 04:58:39,460
Spawner?

4938
04:58:40,440 --> 04:58:42,620
Why is there so much cobweb?

4939
04:58:56,500 --> 04:58:57,340
Oh yeah.

4940
04:59:01,180 --> 04:59:02,320
Love seeing that.

4941
04:59:06,420 --> 04:59:06,860
Wonderful.

4942
04:59:10,060 --> 04:59:12,380
Ooh, even more in... Oh, no.

4943
04:59:13,700 --> 04:59:14,600
It's never-ending.

4944
04:59:15,940 --> 04:59:20,360
I feel like I may have started something I may not be able to finish here.

4945
04:59:20,500 --> 04:59:23,080
Guys, this is kind of crazy.

4946
04:59:24,100 --> 04:59:24,920
Oh, no.

4947
04:59:25,100 --> 04:59:25,760
Wait, I've been here.

4948
04:59:27,400 --> 04:59:28,240
I've been here.

4949
04:59:38,360 --> 04:59:43,060
And the worst part is I'll never know if I actually get everything because, well, I won't know.

4950
04:59:44,940 --> 04:59:45,940
Because I can't tell.

4951
04:59:46,180 --> 04:59:47,420
I don't have x-ray vision, you know?

4952
04:59:50,740 --> 04:59:52,040
Now where did I even come from?

4953
04:59:53,700 --> 04:59:55,000
Also, I'm running out of torches.

4954
04:59:57,380 --> 04:59:58,400
Ah, we can make more.

4955
05:00:01,200 --> 05:00:02,300
I think on our feet here.

4956
05:00:12,500 --> 05:00:13,080
Look at that.

4957
05:00:13,280 --> 05:00:13,860
No problem.

4958
05:00:19,420 --> 05:00:20,780
Man, where was I just before?

4959
05:00:20,940 --> 05:00:21,700
Oh, is it up here?

4960
05:00:21,780 --> 05:00:21,920
Maybe.

4961
05:00:31,580 --> 05:00:34,280
Take me out of the... Here we go, here we go.

4962
05:00:44,110 --> 05:00:46,130
Look at all this fucking mining, though.

4963
05:00:47,090 --> 05:00:50,030
So much coal and... wait, get rid of that.

4964
05:00:50,950 --> 05:00:51,750
Iron and stuff.

4965
05:00:52,070 --> 05:00:56,210
I'm gonna have railway for... well... miles!

4966
05:00:58,930 --> 05:01:00,310
And this is just a start.

4967
05:01:02,710 --> 05:01:03,610
Name check!

4968
05:01:04,130 --> 05:01:05,810
We have five of them now!

4969
05:01:06,130 --> 05:01:07,210
How wild is that?

4970
05:01:10,530 --> 05:01:12,710
Activate a rail in here.

4971
05:01:18,050 --> 05:01:19,070
Everyone gets a name.

4972
05:01:35,930 --> 05:01:38,190
I'm definitely placing more torches than I did in the beginning.

4973
05:01:38,610 --> 05:01:39,170
That's okay.

4974
05:01:42,150 --> 05:01:44,350
I have pretty much infinite torches while I'm down here.

4975
05:01:49,730 --> 05:01:58,690
Oh, and by the way, we're gonna cook all of this in the furnaces when we get home and collect so much experience because we have so much coal.

4976
05:01:59,170 --> 05:02:00,610
We have so much stone at home.

4977
05:02:00,750 --> 05:02:01,790
We can cook all this iron.

4978
05:02:02,530 --> 05:02:05,590
It's going to be absolutely bonkers.

4979
05:02:09,210 --> 05:02:10,550
And we're gonna be level 30.

4980
05:02:10,610 --> 05:02:11,930
We're gonna enchant our gear.

4981
05:02:12,150 --> 05:02:13,050
It's gonna be wonderful.

4982
05:02:16,800 --> 05:02:23,820
See, it's dark up here, but I don't think that matters because there's no real place for the... mobs to spawn, right?

4983
05:02:27,080 --> 05:02:28,620
Fuck, now I'm thinking about that.

4984
05:02:29,160 --> 05:02:30,100
What about spiders?

4985
05:02:30,200 --> 05:02:31,120
Can they spawn in the roof?

4986
05:02:31,260 --> 05:02:32,440
Oh no, maybe they can.

4987
05:02:36,500 --> 05:02:38,360
I'm becoming obsessed with light!

4988
05:02:40,800 --> 05:02:43,540
To the point where I may be losing my mind.

4989
05:02:44,320 --> 05:02:45,080
Just a bit.

4990
05:02:46,200 --> 05:02:48,180
Let's say this cave part here is done.

4991
05:02:48,440 --> 05:02:49,120
We're done with this one.

4992
05:02:49,800 --> 05:02:54,060
Up there, I see some spots that could potentially be problematic.

4993
05:02:55,740 --> 05:02:58,340
No idea if mobs could spawn on that ledge.

4994
05:02:58,460 --> 05:02:59,280
You see that ledge right there?

4995
05:03:00,040 --> 05:03:01,220
Could be problematic.

4996
05:03:02,420 --> 05:03:04,360
Let's eliminate the possibility at least.

4997
05:03:14,600 --> 05:03:15,980
Also, take a look at this inventory.

4998
05:03:16,640 --> 05:03:20,600
That is fantastically well-maintained, isn't it?

4999
05:03:20,780 --> 05:03:21,320
Like, look at this.

5000
05:03:21,620 --> 05:03:21,980
Beautiful.

5001
05:03:22,420 --> 05:03:24,060
And the way everything is organized here.

5002
05:03:24,140 --> 05:03:25,420
I don't think I've ever done this better.

5003
05:03:26,500 --> 05:03:28,520
This is legitimately nice.

5004
05:03:30,620 --> 05:03:31,980
I am so proud of myself.

5005
05:03:32,140 --> 05:03:32,700
That is great.

5006
05:03:33,280 --> 05:03:34,240
This one can go away.

5007
05:03:44,180 --> 05:03:45,560
Let's light this part.

5008
05:03:45,780 --> 05:03:46,160
Boom.

5009
05:03:49,720 --> 05:03:50,660
And there.

5010
05:03:56,000 --> 05:03:56,760
Okay.

5011
05:03:57,880 --> 05:03:58,680
Let's go.

5012
05:04:03,180 --> 05:04:05,200
All of this is lit.

5013
05:04:06,260 --> 05:04:08,300
I would say we're doing wonderful.

5014
05:04:12,800 --> 05:04:13,120
Whoop!

5015
05:04:13,280 --> 05:04:14,400
Didn't mean to drop all that weight out.

5016
05:04:14,840 --> 05:04:15,540
Let's get out of here.

5017
05:04:17,640 --> 05:04:18,780
I'm leaving through this crack.

5018
05:04:25,050 --> 05:04:32,650
Now I gotta go down into my other... So right beneath my village, there is a huge cave.

5019
05:04:32,730 --> 05:04:38,150
In fact, right below my... Well, I won't call it the Orphan Crusher, but... Oh, look at this now.

5020
05:04:39,230 --> 05:04:41,550
Ooh, I see enemies!

5021
05:04:42,330 --> 05:04:44,470
That means we have some cleaning to do.

5022
05:04:48,270 --> 05:04:49,750
It's actually kind of reassuring.

5023
05:04:50,090 --> 05:04:53,130
Seeing these enemies here, it means, yeah, enemies spawned here, you know?

5024
05:04:53,290 --> 05:04:53,470
Boom.

5025
05:04:54,490 --> 05:04:55,830
That means we need to block it.

5026
05:04:56,490 --> 05:04:57,670
You have seen it happen.

5027
05:04:58,050 --> 05:04:58,910
Gotta stop it.

5028
05:04:59,930 --> 05:05:01,090
Actually, really nice feeling.

5029
05:05:14,150 --> 05:05:19,810
Oh no, this is actually... How am I ever gonna know if I got all the caves?

5030
05:05:20,290 --> 05:05:23,070
Is this an impossible job that I put on myself here?

5031
05:05:26,230 --> 05:05:29,850
It very well could be a fool's errand, if you will.

5032
05:05:42,380 --> 05:05:43,080
Wait a minute.

5033
05:05:43,860 --> 05:05:56,780
If my theory is correct here, me doing all of this right here will actually result in my village being attacked more frequently by mobs, right?

5034
05:05:57,760 --> 05:06:02,000
Because let's say the interns can't find a spot down here anymore.

5035
05:06:02,120 --> 05:06:03,640
They're like, oh, well, guess it's night.

5036
05:06:03,940 --> 05:06:05,840
We can put them outside the village, you know?

5037
05:06:06,720 --> 05:06:10,260
It's gonna be a fucking bloodbath out there.

5038
05:06:12,620 --> 05:06:15,280
Maybe I do a perimeter of thorny bushes.

5039
05:06:15,780 --> 05:06:18,700
So that if they walk through it, they take damage.

5040
05:06:19,580 --> 05:06:20,960
Dude, I need a moat.

5041
05:06:21,720 --> 05:06:26,200
I need myself... Dude... Think about this.

5042
05:06:26,440 --> 05:06:28,700
We're gonna have a moat around the village.

5043
05:06:29,480 --> 05:06:32,500
And we're gonna install a float, trademark.

5044
05:06:33,260 --> 05:06:37,360
Everywhere, and it all leads down into one great float.

5045
05:06:37,720 --> 05:06:39,500
Also called the Big GF.

5046
05:06:40,150 --> 05:06:43,190
Underneath, and it funnels everything into one kill chamber.

5047
05:06:44,210 --> 05:06:49,430
So the mode itself is the flow that leads into kill chamber in the center.

5048
05:06:52,730 --> 05:06:53,650
How about that?

5049
05:06:55,730 --> 05:06:58,330
I think I've become obsessed with flows and kill chambers.

5050
05:07:01,590 --> 05:07:04,030
It's all my mind is thinking about, you know?

5051
05:07:13,880 --> 05:07:14,900
Please don't explode.

5052
05:07:15,440 --> 05:07:16,140
Okay, nice.

5053
05:07:17,320 --> 05:07:17,760
Boink.

5054
05:07:17,920 --> 05:07:18,820
Wow, he died instantly.

5055
05:07:19,140 --> 05:07:20,340
I guess I hit him with an arrow.

5056
05:07:24,150 --> 05:07:25,490
No more spawns here.

5057
05:07:26,050 --> 05:07:28,370
No, I have shot this down.

5058
05:07:28,670 --> 05:07:34,550
This is basically me being the police officer showing up at the party.

5059
05:07:34,770 --> 05:07:36,550
You know, arresting everyone for drinking.

5060
05:07:37,190 --> 05:07:39,270
Not really, but that's what I imagine in my mind.

5061
05:07:39,450 --> 05:07:41,090
That never happens in Denmark, by the way.

5062
05:07:41,150 --> 05:07:42,430
That's a US thing only, I think.

5063
05:07:43,990 --> 05:07:47,370
Well, because in Denmark you can drink when you're... What is it?

5064
05:07:48,210 --> 05:07:48,650
15?

5065
05:07:50,030 --> 05:07:52,470
And with your parents' consent, I think it's like...

5066
05:07:52,590 --> 05:07:54,510
There's no limit you can drink when you're 10.

5067
05:07:54,910 --> 05:07:56,950
As long as your parents say, yeah, sure, go for it.

5068
05:07:57,670 --> 05:07:58,310
Then it's fine.

5069
05:07:58,390 --> 05:07:59,370
You just can't buy it, you know?

5070
05:07:59,690 --> 05:08:00,170
That's all.

5071
05:08:02,350 --> 05:08:02,710
Hello!

5072
05:08:05,010 --> 05:08:05,630
There we go.

5073
05:08:06,630 --> 05:08:09,290
I think hard liquor is 16 years old in Denmark.

5074
05:08:10,050 --> 05:08:12,370
Like, anything above 16% or something?

5075
05:08:12,530 --> 05:08:13,970
Or is it like 13%?

5076
05:08:14,130 --> 05:08:14,410
I forget.

5077
05:08:15,670 --> 05:08:16,710
Then you need to be 18.

5078
05:08:17,630 --> 05:08:18,510
Then you can buy that.

5079
05:08:21,170 --> 05:08:21,710
Cave-in!

5080
05:08:26,210 --> 05:08:28,750
You know how when a tree falls, people go, Simba!

5081
05:08:29,010 --> 05:08:30,570
Actually, why do they even say that?

5082
05:08:31,090 --> 05:08:32,970
But is there a similar thing for cave-ins?

5083
05:08:37,230 --> 05:08:38,170
It's gotta be something.

5084
05:08:50,770 --> 05:08:51,270
Lava.

5085
05:08:51,270 --> 05:08:52,050
Also, where?

5086
05:08:52,190 --> 05:08:52,370
Okay.

5087
05:08:52,710 --> 05:08:53,890
Right now, I've been wandering.

5088
05:08:54,030 --> 05:08:55,830
Maybe I'm so far away, it doesn't even matter.

5089
05:08:56,290 --> 05:08:57,810
I need to do a quick test.

5090
05:08:58,750 --> 05:08:59,850
Sanity check incoming.

5091
05:09:00,330 --> 05:09:02,050
Where the fuck are we right now?

5092
05:09:02,610 --> 05:09:04,270
In this exact spot.

5093
05:09:04,430 --> 05:09:04,790
Let's see.

5094
05:09:06,310 --> 05:09:08,410
Are we wasting our time right now?

5095
05:09:10,990 --> 05:09:11,790
Oh, interesting.

5096
05:09:13,630 --> 05:09:14,690
Wait, let me...

5097
05:09:16,550 --> 05:09:17,530
That's where I came from.

5098
05:09:21,950 --> 05:09:22,630
Oh, you know what?

5099
05:09:22,790 --> 05:09:23,130
Okay.

5100
05:09:23,810 --> 05:09:25,330
I'm already getting distracted again.

5101
05:09:26,990 --> 05:09:27,930
Can't pack up there.

5102
05:09:29,570 --> 05:09:30,750
We're gonna keep going up.

5103
05:09:39,450 --> 05:09:40,730
Podcasting for just a bit here.

5104
05:09:40,950 --> 05:09:42,530
Oh, wow, we're close to the surface.

5105
05:09:42,830 --> 05:09:43,190
